    "{\n",
    " \"cells\": [\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# Antibiotic Resistance Clinical Analysis (2026)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Author: Roni Cohen\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**Project Goal:** The primary objective of this project is to analyze antibiotic resistance patterns within a large-scale clinical dataset to identify key drivers of resistance and evaluate the effectiveness of current treatment protocols.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**Data Source:** [Antibiotic Susceptibility Dataset](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/adilimadeddinehosni/multi-resistance-antibiotic-susceptibility) from Kaggle.\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"53bab4715345489a\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-03-08T10:45:52.638795Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-03-08T10:45:52.060069Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"import pandas as pd\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import seaborn as sns\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# טעינת הנתונים\\n\",\n",
    "    \"df = pd.read_csv('data/Bacteria_resistance_data.csv')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# פונקציה לאיחוד שמות חיידקים (Standardization)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"def clean_names(name):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    name = str(name).lower()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    if 'coli' in name: return 'Escherichia coli'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    if 'mirabilis' in name: return 'Proteus mirabilis'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    if 'pneumoniae' in name: return 'Klebsiella pneumoniae'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    return 'Other'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"df['Bacteria_Name'] = df['Souches'].apply(clean_names)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# ניקוי גיל\\n\",\n",
    "    \"df['Age'] = df['age/gender'].apply(lambda x: float(str(x).split('/')[0]) if '/' in str(x) else None)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# הגדרת רשימת האנטיביוטיקות\\n\",\n",
    "    \"antibiotics = ['AMX/AMP', 'AMC', 'CZ', 'FOX', 'CTX/CRO', 'IPM', 'GEN', 'AN', 'CIP', 'colistine']\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\" הנתונים מוכנים לניתוח!\\\")\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"90e1970ba0f49d14\",\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "     \"name\": \"stdout\",\n",
    "     \"output_type\": \"stream\",\n",
    "     \"text\": [\n",
    "      \" הנתונים מוכנים לניתוח!\\n\"\n",
    "     ]\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 6\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-03-08T10:45:52.859165Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-03-08T10:45:52.718184Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# ספירת עמידויות לכל דגימה\\n\",\n",
    "    \"df['R_Count'] = (df[antibiotics] == 'R').sum(axis=1)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# חלוקה לקטגוריות MDR/XDR\\n\",\n",
    "    \"def assign_risk(count):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    if count == 0: return 'Sensitive'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    if count <= 2: return 'Low Resistance'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    if count <= 5: return 'MDR (Multi-Drug Resistant)'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    return 'XDR (Extensively Resistant)'\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"df['Risk_Level'] = df['R_Count'].apply(assign_risk)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# הצגת התפלגות רמות הסיכון\\n\",\n",
    "    \"risk_counts = df['Risk_Level'].value_counts(normalize=True) * 100\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"--- התפלגות רמות סיכון באחוזים ---\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(risk_counts)\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"852935f27380d03e\",\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "     \"name\": \"stdout\",\n",
    "     \"output_type\": \"stream\",\n",
    "     \"text\": [\n",
    "      \"--- התפלגות רמות סיכון באחוזים ---\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Risk_Level\\n\",\n",
    "      \"MDR (Multi-Drug Resistant)     41.708683\\n\",\n",
    "      \"XDR (Extensively Resistant)    26.965453\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Low Resistance                 18.272642\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Sensitive                      13.053221\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Name: proportion, dtype: float64\\n\"\n",
    "     ]\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 7\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-03-08T10:47:33.204860Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-03-08T10:47:32.256845Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# יצירת מדד MDR (3 עמידויות ומעלה)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"df['Is_MDR'] = df['R_Count'] >= 3\\n\",\n",
    "    \"mdr_stats = df.groupby('Bacteria_Name')['Is_MDR'].mean().sort_values(ascending=False) * 100\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))\\n\",\n",
    "    \"sns.barplot(x=mdr_stats.values, y=mdr_stats.index, hue=mdr_stats.index, dodge=False, palette='magma', legend=False)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"plt.xlabel('MDR Percentage (%)')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"plt.ylabel('Bacteria')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"plt.show()\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"ce893737140db6b6\",\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "     \"data\": {\n",
    "      \"text/plain\": [\n",
    "       \"<Figure size 1000x600 with 1 Axes>\"\n",
    "      ],\n",
    "      \"image/png\": \"\"\n",
    "     },\n",
    "     \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "     \"output_type\": \"display_data\",\n",
    "     \"jetTransient\": {\n",
    "      \"display_id\": null\n",
    "     }\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 11\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-03-08T10:45:54.063155Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-03-08T10:45:53.965307Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"import pandas as pd\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 1. הכנת הנתונים וניקוי (רק Yes ו-No)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"df_clean = df[df['Hospital_before'].isin(['Yes', 'No'])].copy()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 2. חישוב שיעור ה-MDR בכל קבוצה (Prevalence)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# מחשבים את הממוצע (mean) שזה בעצם ההסתברות ל-True\\n\",\n",
    "    \"rates = df_clean.groupby('Hospital_before')['Is_MDR'].mean()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"rate_no = rates['No']\\n\",\n",
    "    \"rate_yes = rates['Yes']\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 3. חישוב הסיכון היחסי (Relative Risk - RR)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# נוסחה: סיכון בקבוצת החשיפה חלקי סיכון בקבוצת הביקורת\\n\",\n",
    "    \"relative_risk = rate_yes / rate_no\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"--- Statistical Analysis: Hospitalization as a Risk Factor ---\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"MDR Rate (No Hospitalization): {rate_no:.2%}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"MDR Rate (With Hospitalization): {rate_yes:.2%}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"Relative Risk (RR): {relative_risk:.4f}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 4. הסבר אוטומטי לתוצאה\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"\\\\n--- Interpretation ---\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"if 0.95 <= relative_risk <= 1.05:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"The Relative Risk is approximately 1.\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"Conclusion: Statistically, there is NO correlation between prior hospitalization and MDR.\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"This is typical for synthetic datasets where variables are randomized independently.\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"elif relative_risk > 1.05:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"The risk of MDR is {relative_risk:.2f} times higher in hospitalized patients.\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"Conclusion: Prior hospitalization is a significant risk factor.\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"else:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"The risk of MDR is lower in hospitalized patients (uncommon in clinical settings).\\\")\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"9001e59e39b12c7\",\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "     \"name\": \"stdout\",\n",
    "     \"output_type\": \"stream\",\n",
    "     \"text\": [\n",
    "      \"--- Statistical Analysis: Hospitalization as a Risk Factor ---\\n\",\n",
    "      \"MDR Rate (No Hospitalization): 73.92%\\n\",\n",
    "      \"MDR Rate (With Hospitalization): 74.00%\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Relative Risk (RR): 1.0012\\n\",\n",
    "      \"\\n\",\n",
    "      \"--- Interpretation ---\\n\",\n",
    "      \"The Relative Risk is approximately 1.\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Conclusion: Statistically, there is NO correlation between prior hospitalization and MDR.\\n\",\n",
    "      \"This is typical for synthetic datasets where variables are randomized independently.\\n\"\n",
    "     ]\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 9\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-02-02T17:42:34.512755Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-02-02T17:42:34.495460Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# Conclusions\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 1. Widespread and Concerning Resistance\\n\",\n",
    "    \"The most striking finding is that over **68%** of the bacteria tested are classified as either **MDR** (Multidrug-Resistant) or **XDR** (Extensively Drug-Resistant).\\n\",\n",
    "    \"> **Impact:** For the majority of patients, standard antibiotic treatments may fail, making clinical management significantly more complex.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 2. Statistical Risk Analysis: Hospitalization\\n\",\n",
    "    \"To determine if prior hospitalization increases the risk of resistance, we calculated the **Relative Risk (RR)**.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| Metric | Result | Interpretation |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| **MDR Rate (No Hospital)** | 73.92% | Baseline community resistance |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| **MDR Rate (Hospital)** | 74.00% | Hospital-acquired resistance |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"| **Relative Risk (RR)** | **1.0012** | **No statistical correlation** |\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**Conclusion:** The probability of being MDR is nearly identical regardless of hospitalization history. This suggests that resistance is already pervasive outside the hospital setting in this dataset.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 3. Patient Profile & Burden\\n\",\n",
    "    \"While the *individual* risk is the same, the *total volume* of cases tells a different story:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"* **70.4%** of all MDR cases originated from patients with **no recent hospitalization**.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"* **29.6%** of cases came from hospitalized patients.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"* **Insight:** The primary burden of resistance in this sample comes from the general community.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 4. Pathogen & Treatment Analysis\\n\",\n",
    "    \"* **The Main Culprit:** *E. coli* is the most prevalent pathogen. Monitoring this specific bacteria is key to any resistance strategy.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"* **Age Factor:** Average resistance levels (approx. 2.15 drugs) remain stable across all age groups, affecting young and old alike.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"* **Last-Line Defenses:** \\\"Last-resort\\\" drugs like **Imipenem (IPM)** and **Colistin** still show high success rates, but must be used cautiously to remain effective.\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"80eb6ea7370c903d\"\n",
    "  },\n",
